<div class="home">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="front-headline">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1 class="hero-title" id="front-headline">Team agrees: it’s an <span class="figure is-stamped">8</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        Planning poker for teams on a call. Share one link, everyone votes in secret, the facilitator reveals,
        and the room closes itself after 10 minutes. No sign-up, nothing to install.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="open" id="open" aria-labelledby="open-title">
      <h2 class="open-title" id="open-title">Open a room</h2>
      <form class="form" method="post" action="/register">
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field-label" for="couponName">Your name</label>
          <input type="text" id="couponName" name="name" class="input" placeholder="e.g. Marta" required maxlength="40" autocomplete="off" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="field-label" for="couponTask">Task title</label>
          <input type="text" id="couponTask" name="taskTitle" class="input" placeholder="e.g. Implement user authentication" required autocomplete="off" />
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-wide">Open a room</button>
        <p class="open-note">You get the link to share straight away. <a href="/play">Add a description or links</a></p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <figure class="photo" id="landing-demo">
      <ul class="plaques photo-plaques" id="demoPlaques" aria-label="Sample table">
        <li class="plaque is-revealed is-voted" style="--i: 0"><span class="plaque-name">Marta</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number">8</span></li>
        <li class="plaque is-revealed is-voted" style="--i: 1"><span class="plaque-name">Jordi</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number">8</span></li>
        <li class="plaque is-revealed is-voted" style="--i: 2"><span class="plaque-name">Aina</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number">5</span></li>
        <li class="plaque is-revealed is-voted" style="--i: 3"><span class="plaque-name">Pau</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number">8</span></li>
        <li class="plaque is-revealed is-voted" style="--i: 4"><span class="plaque-name">Núria</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number">13</span></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="results-body photo-results">
        <div class="average">
          <span class="average-label">Average</span>
          <span class="average-value" id="demoAverage">8.4</span>
          <span class="average-nearest" id="demoNearest">Nearest card <strong>8</strong></span>
        </div>
        <ul class="split" id="demoSplit" aria-label="The split">
          <li class="split-row" aria-label="1 vote for 5"><span class="split-value">5<span class="split-value-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🤓</span></span><span class="split-blocks" aria-hidden="true"><span class="split-block"></span></span><span class="split-count" aria-hidden="true">×1</span></li>
          <li class="split-row is-top" aria-label="3 votes for 8"><span class="split-value">8<span class="split-value-emoji" aria-hidden="true">💪</span></span><span class="split-blocks" aria-hidden="true"><span class="split-block"></span><span class="split-block"></span><span class="split-block"></span></span><span class="split-count" aria-hidden="true">×3</span></li>
          <li class="split-row" aria-label="1 vote for 13"><span class="split-value">13<span class="split-value-emoji" aria-hidden="true">🧙</span></span><span class="split-blocks" aria-hidden="true"><span class="split-block"></span></span><span class="split-count" aria-hidden="true">×1</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <figcaption class="photo-caption">
        <span>A sample round. The names and votes are made up.</span>
        <button class="btn btn-quiet btn-compact" type="button" id="dealBtn" hidden>Deal another round</button>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="notes" aria-label="What makes it different">
    <article class="note">
      <h2 class="note-title">Votes stay secret</h2>
      <div class="note-figure" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="plaque plaque-mini"><span class="plaque-name">Aina</span><span class="plaque-state">Thinking</span><span class="plaque-number"></span></span>
        <span class="plaque plaque-mini is-voted"><span class="plaque-name">Pau</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number"></span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-text">
        Everyone sees who has voted, never what. The numbers appear only when the facilitator reveals, so nobody
        anchors on the first or loudest estimate.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="note">
      <h2 class="note-title">The room clears itself</h2>
      <div class="note-figure" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="countdown"><span class="countdown-label">Closes in</span><span class="countdown-value">10:00</span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="note-text">
        Rooms close after 10 minutes, or 30 seconds after the last person leaves. No accounts, no history, nothing
        left behind.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="inside" aria-labelledby="inside-title">
    <header class="inside-head">
      <h2 class="inside-title" id="inside-title">How a round goes</h2>
      <p class="inside-meta">Built for the side of a call: it works in a 400px window next to Meet, Zoom or Teams.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-figure" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="step-input">Refactor the login page</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Name the task</h3>
        <p class="step-text">Type your name and the task. Paste a Jira link in the description if the team needs it.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-figure" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="step-link">pokerestima…/play/4f2a</span>
          <span class="step-copy">Copy</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Share the link</h3>
        <p class="step-text">Drop it in the call chat. Up to 10 people type a name and take a seat.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-figure step-cards" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="step-card">3</span>
          <span class="step-card is-picked">5</span>
          <span class="step-card">8</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Tap a card</h3>
        <p class="step-text">One tap is the vote. Change your mind until the reveal, or type the number on your keyboard.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-figure" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="plaque plaque-mini is-revealed is-voted"><span class="plaque-name">Jordi</span><span class="plaque-state">Voted</span><span class="plaque-number">5</span></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-title">Reveal and talk</h3>
        <p class="step-text">The facilitator reveals. Numbers stamp in with the average and the split, then talk it through or deal again.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="support" aria-labelledby="support-title">
    <h2 class="support-title" id="support-title">Keep the rooms open</h2>
    <p class="support-text">
      PokerEstima is made by one person. It’s free to use, open source and has no ads. If it saved your
      refinement meeting, you can chip in any amount on Ko-fi to keep the rooms running.
    </p>
    <div class="support-actions">
      <div class="kofi">
        <script type='text/javascript' src='https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/widget/Widget_2.js'></script><script type='text/javascript'>kofiwidget2.init('Support me on Ko-fi', '#8073f5', 'O5I528IC3A');kofiwidget2.draw();</script>
        <noscript><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://ko-fi.com/O5I528IC3A">Support me on Ko-fi</a></noscript>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="https://github.com/joaoGabriel55/PokerEstima">
        <svg class="btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 .5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.41c.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2c-3.2.7-3.88-1.37-3.88-1.37-.52-1.33-1.28-1.69-1.28-1.69-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.69 0-1.26.45-2.29 1.19-3.1-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.17 1.18a11 11 0 0 1 5.77 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.84 1.19 3.1 0 4.42-2.69 5.39-5.26 5.68.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5z" />
        </svg>
        Read the code on GitHub
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
